  "question": {
    "text": "Two tangent galvanometers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo></math>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> have coils of radii <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> respectively and resistance <math><mn>8</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math> each. They are connected in parallel with a cell of emf <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> and negligible internal resistance. The deflections produced in the tangent galvanometers A and B are <math><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>°</mo></math> respectively. If A has&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> turns, then the number of turns <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> must have is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "12",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Current in tangent galvanometer<br /><br /><math><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0009_222806709e2d.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 166px; height: 150px;\" /><br /><br />From Eq. (i), we get<br /><br /><math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>r</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo> <mtext>&nbsp;same for both</mtext></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>"
